SUMMARY:Impromptu - HSC LMS Series 1 (23R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: open\n\nAverage Pa
 ce 14-16 mph\n\nThis ride has no Ride with GPS file. Join me to create one
  by riding it.\nCue Sheet: [Old School Cue Sheet](https://routes.lancaster
 bikeclub.net/cue/hsc-lms-series-1-23r/)\n\nAfter the ride for a beverage o
 r food. [Blue Collar](http://www.bluecollarlanc.com/)\n\nRide leader will 
 ride at the advertised average speed\, unless at the back. This is intende
 d to be a no-drop group ride. You can ride ahead if you want to.\n\nHelmet
 s are mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic 
 repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup
  Member does not mean you are a club member. Use this [link to join](https
 ://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148) the c
 lub.\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct]
 (https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2571
 48&module_id=323984) and [Rules of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpr
 ess.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3144207
 15/
